<title>EGYPT: EGYPT POUND O/N AND WEEKLY RATES FALL.</title>
<headline>EGYPT POUND O/N AND WEEKLY RATES FALL.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Overnight rates on the Egyptian pound fell in the private sector market on Thursday to between 8 and 8-3/4 percent compared to Wednesday's range of 8-3/4 and 9-1/2 percent, bankers said.</p>
<p>&quot;The market is liquid in Egyptian deposits,&quot; said one.</p>
<p>One-week rates were put at 8-1/4 and 9-1/4 by two banks compared to 9-1/2 percent on Wednesday. Two other banks said they did not carry out any one-week deals.</p>
<p>$1 = 3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/1</p>
